{"id":"ai_image","title":"How does AI turn words into an image?","ig_caption":"AI image generators start from pure noise and clean it up, step by step. Here's the idea in 60 seconds.","hashtags":["#ai","#aiart","#midjourney","#howitworks","#tech"],
